  %% @mode architecture
  %% @subtitle AI review of agent traces, embedded in the LiteLLM dashboard and built from a pinned Lens commit
  %% @card cyan | Trace path | Agents upload OTLP traces to LENS_HOST/v1/traces with a tracing key | Gateways export content-free spend records for cost matching | Lens keeps traces for LENS_TRACE_RETENTION_DAYS
  %% @card violet | Isolation | ClickHouse and its Keeper sit alone with Lens on lens-storage | Gateways enable Lens only while the lens service resolves | lens-preflight rejects missing or reused secrets
  %% @card rose | Access | Gateway admins open Lens in the dashboard with their session | The standalone UI needs LENS_ADMIN_TOKEN | Analysis models run only through a dedicated gateway key
  %% @journey #22d3ee: AG TR LN CH
  %% @journey #a78bfa: OP TR LL LN

